                "fallback": "Excited to share that I am now a full-time Photoroomer, joining the mission to bring studio-quality AI product visuals to marketplaces &amp; e-commerce!   I feel very lucky to be part of this full-time… | Elizabeth Coleon",
                "text": "Excited to share that I am now a full-time Photoroomer, joining the mission to bring studio-quality AI product visuals to marketplaces &amp; e-commerce! \n\nI feel very lucky to be part of this full-time adventure after enjoying advisory &amp; fractional work in 2025 for:\n\nPhotoroom's unique culture including combining customer-centric “ship fast” approach with kindness. It manages keeping remote-first flexibility with a tight-knit team through monthly gatherings, a no Direct message slack policy to support transparency and fast feedback. I’ve been lucky to work in great cultures before, but I know they are not easy to find! \n\nThe pace of AI. It's exciting to see what our teams are shipping each day. Our customers whether they are side-hustler sellers, small businesses, or large enterprises like DoorDash, Depop or Decathlon, can create studio quality product visuals for millions of images at a fraction of budgets I spent for 1 photoshoot. \n\nThank you Photoroomers — especially Matt Rouif, Eliot Andres &amp; the very talented marketing &amp; growth team :sparkles:—  for creating this environment for innovation, your trust and the warm welcome!\n\nLet’s goooooo! :rocket:",
                "title": "Excited to share that I am now a full-time Photoroomer, joining the mission to bring studio-quality AI product visuals to marketplaces &amp; e-commerce!   I feel very lucky to be part of this full-time… | Elizabeth Coleon",
